1..7
ok 1 - Typename:: is a Stash
ok 2 - can access a subroutine in the stash
ok 3 - A::  returns the same as A.WHO
ok 4 - can autovivify an our-variable in a class package through its long name from class method
ok 5 - but a lexical of the same name is independent
